WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,950
Right

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:03,550
This is the two hundred gold coins you won from the bet between you and Hou San.

3
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:04,870
This money is enough for ordinary people

4
00:00:04,870 --> 00:00:06,390
I don’t know how many years the expenses will be.

5
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:07,990
Didn't I say I'd give you two percent?

6
00:00:07,990 --> 00:00:09,150
What are you talking about?

7
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:10,990
Being my brother will make you suffer a lot

8
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,470
You won with your own ability

9
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:14,870
Not to mention that I won twenty pounds by betting on you.

10
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,290
I'll go back to Lumaofeng first.

11
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:25,850
Remember that important people bully you

12
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:26,850
Just call me brother

13
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:28,130
Guaranteed to support you

14
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:35,830
Junior Brother Chu is back

15
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:36,910
are you okay

16
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:39,180
Senior Brother Gu

17
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:44,560
As long as you're not hurt

18
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,000
You disappeared for two whole days

19
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,790
But I'm worried to death

20
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:49,710
It's actually been so long after two days

21
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,070
Sorry it happened suddenly

22
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:54,710
It doesn’t matter that the emperor failed to inform Senior Brother Gu in advance about the important personnel’s work.

23
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:57,510
Anyway, I have always been in charge of this important matter by myself.

24
00:00:57,510 --> 00:00:58,510
Don't worry

25
00:00:58,510 --> 00:01:00,590
I've been taking care of the important people for you these two days.

26
00:01:00,590 --> 00:01:02,230
Brother Tu came over and asked once

27
00:01:02,230 --> 00:01:06,440
I coped with it

28
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:07,650
these two days

29
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:09,610
Not only did you take over my job

30
00:01:09,610 --> 00:01:11,010
Moreover, Tu Jiarong came from you.

31
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:13,400
You got a lot of benefits, right?
